1
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:02,820
好了 伙计们
Okay, gang.

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:05,780
今晚 录影带告别仪式继续
Tonight, the Farewell to VHS Festival continues.

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,420
大寒潮[《山水又相逢》]以来 这里变得很冷
It's been mighty cold in here since "The Big Chill."

4
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,820
能够温暖我们内心的就是
What say we warm our hearts by...

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,180
圣艾尔摩之火[电影《七个毕业生》]
"St. Elmo's Fire"?

6
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,000
没错
Yes!

7
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:16,660
一边喝清爽酒 一边看80年代帅哥
Couple of wine coolers and some '80s Rob Lowe--

8
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,520
我应该会喜欢
I can get into that.

9
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:20,000
我还是希望今晚有我自己的计划
I'm still holding out hope I'll have plans tonight.

10
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:21,560
太好了 两个都赞同 海莉呢
Great. Two for two. Haley?

11
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,120
听起来很有意思 但我没空参加
Oh, so fun, but I'm gonna have to say no.

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,380
我有个摄影课的事情
I have a photography-class thing.

13
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,140
什么事情
What kind of a thing?

14
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,660
就是展览嘛
Oh, you know, just an exhibit,

15
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:28,800
展示我们的照片什么的
like, to show our photos.

16
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,260
需要我们参加吗
Is it something that we should go to?

17
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,560
克莱尔 我们有计划了
Claire, we just made plans.

18
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,460
老妈 这是大学的课程
Mom, this is a college class.

19
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:34,580
我不是三年级小学生了
I'm not in the third grade.

20
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,040
你们不是还有午休时间么
Don't you have nap time there?

21
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:37,840
没有 我只有空课时间
No. I have free periods,

22
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,000
那时候我才偶尔午休一下
during which I sometimes nap.

23
00:00:42,215 --> 00:00:42,982
是我想多了
Is it me,

24
00:00:42,982 --> 00:00:45,100
还是她刚刚故意说得很含糊
or was she just being purposefully vague?

25
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,740
艾丽克斯 你去看看她的东西
Alex, I want you to go through her stuff

26
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,640
查出她今晚到底是干嘛
and find out about this thing tonight.

27
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:49,380
等等
Wait, wait.

28
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:51,580
我觉得我们这样窥探不太好
I-I don't feel good about us snooping.

29
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,520
我知道 所以我才让艾丽克斯去做
I know. That's why I told Alex to do it.

30
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:56,180
我觉得海莉知道的比看上去的多
I think Haley knows more than she's letting on.

31
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,320
你这样想真是伤透了我的心
It breaks my heart how badly you want to believe that.

32
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,760
我们过会儿见
We'll see you guys later.

33
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:00,520
你们要去哪里
Where are you going?

34
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,020
骑自行车去赞德家
Riding our bikes to Xander's.

35
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,000
你们去那里干什么
What are you doing there?

36
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,440
不知道啊 就一起玩玩
I don't know. Hanging out.

37
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:06,000
听起来很有意思 戴上头盔哦
Sounds fun. Wear your helmets.

38
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:06,600
会的
We will.

39
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:09,080
我可不想插着呼吸机写我的第一本小说
I'm not writing my first novel by blowing through a tube.

40
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:12,660
我不喜欢他们去那孩子家
I don't like them going over to that kid's house.

41
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:13,240
为什么
Why not?

42
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:15,284
赞德会带坏他们的
Mm, Xander's a bad influence.

43
00:01:15,284 --> 00:01:16,840
他哥哥简直更糟糕
His older brother is even worse.

44
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:18,140
满身肌肉的大块头 很爱抽大麻
Huge stoner always walking around

45
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:19,680
总穿着他的军装瞎晃悠
in his army jacket with his muscles,

46
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:21,320
还老喜欢拨弄头发 露出蓝眼睛
flipping his hair out of his blue eyes.

47
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:22,520
他有一次还说我漂亮
He told me I was looking good one time.

48
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,460
拜托省省吧
I mean, come on.

49
00:01:23,504 --> 00:01:24,438
好吧 我们会留意的
Yeah, we'll keep our eye on that.

50
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:27,240
但现在问题是赞德 我不信任他
But for now...Xander. I don't trust him.

51
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:28,920
克莱尔 你真是难以捉摸
Claire, you're a tough one to figure out.

52
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:32,160
你不信任坏男孩 却嫁给了我
You don't trust bad boys, and yet you married one.

53
00:01:47,315 --> 00:01:50,100
我的帅小子饿坏了
My handsome boy's so hungry.

54
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:51,780
好了 我很快回来
All right. Be back in a few.

55
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:54,460
如果小短打电话来 告诉他我死了
If Shorty calls, tell him I died,

56
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,120
但要保证让他信服
but make sure you really sell it.

57
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,300
我们在玩一个很有趣的游戏
It's a funny thing we're doing.

58
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,240
那怎么会好玩
How is that funny?

59
00:01:58,460 --> 00:01:59,180
我就知道你会这样说
I knew you'd say that.

60
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:00,680
总之别接电话 再见 伙计
Just don't answer the phone. Bye, buddy.

61
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,520
这是怎么回事
What's all that about?

62
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:06,160
你生我气了还是怎么了
You mad at me or something?

63
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:07,020
我不知道
I don't know.

64
00:02:07,220 --> 00:02:08,660
你有做什么让我生气的事吗
Did you do something to make me mad?

65
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:09,680
那样的话 我就是在生气
Because then I am.

66
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,360
如果没有 我就没生气
But if you didn't, then I am not.

67
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,220
我什么也没干啊
I didn't do anything.

68
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,420
那我就没生气
Then I am not mad.

69
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,760
我生气了
I am mad.

70
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:18,460
昨晚 杰做了个有关别的女人的春梦
Last night, Jay had a sexy dream about some woman.

71
00:02:26,740 --> 00:02:27,160
宝贝
Baby.

72
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:29,960
宝贝
Oh, baby.

73
00:02:30,860 --> 00:02:31,987
宝贝
Oh, baby!

74
00:02:35,255 --> 00:02:36,480
我知道那不是我
And I know it wasn't about me,

75
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:38,660
因为他知道我讨厌男人叫我宝贝
Because he knows that I hate when men call me baby.

76
00:02:38,753 --> 00:02:41,780
没错 人们允许有自己的私密想法
And, yes, people are allowed their private thoughts,

77
00:02:41,780 --> 00:02:43,520
我也不应该这么生气
and I shouldn't be so angry,

78
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:46,960
但我是拉丁人 所以姐想生气就生气
But I am latin, so I get to feel whatever I want.

79
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,840
你想跟我说我干了什么吗
You want to tell me what I did?

80
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:50,460
你想跟我说你干了什么吗
Do you want to tell me what you did?

81
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:51,260
我不知道我干了什么啊
I don't know what I did.

82
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,680
那我就不知道你干了什么
Then I don't know what you did.

83
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:54,280
我受够了 我要走了
I'm bored. I'm going.

84
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,340
别忘了你的手机
Don't forget your phone.

85
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:00,440
我手臂上有片淤青
I got a bruise on my arm.

86
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:01,540
不知道从哪儿来的
I don't know where it came from.

87
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,960
可怜的宝贝
Oh, poor baby.

88
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:08,900
于是我意识到
And then I realized

89
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,660
我不想为查理工作了
I don't want to work for Charlie anymore.

90
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:11,540
我真正想要的是
What I really want --

91
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:12,760
抱歉 我听不下去了
I'm sorry. I can't listen to this.

92
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:14,320
我要跟你说件事
I need to tell you something,

93
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,720
但你得保密
but you have to keep it a secret.

94
00:03:15,900 --> 00:03:17,020
当然 我是律师
Of course. I'm a lawyer.

95
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,400
我还听过谋杀供述呢
I've heard murder confessions.

96
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,960
-真的吗 -好吧 在
- Really? - Well, in --

97
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,831
在法学院的模拟法庭上
in mock trials at law school.

98
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,200
不过我还是守口如瓶
But still, I never told anyone.

99
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:24,160
说真的 只跟你说
Seriously, this is only for you.

100
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,000
连小卡都不能说 你能保证吗
You can't even tell Cam. Promise?

101
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,000
好
Uh, okay.

102
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,020
你还好吗
Is everything all right?

103
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,400
看桌子下面
Look under the table.

104
00:03:30,860 --> 00:03:32,900
脚踝以上 膝盖以下 你看到什么了
Above the ankle, below the knee, what do you see?

105
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,260
我对此有点紧张 但是
I'm a little nervous about this, but --

106
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:36,280
天啊 你没有吧
Oh, oh, my gosh! You didn't?

107
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,883
我做了 小腿肌肉植入
I did. Calf implants.

108
00:03:37,883 --> 00:03:39,540
你还真是没少往里面植入啊
Wow, and you really went for it, didn't you?

109
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:40,620
不不不 它们还肿着呢
No, no, no. They're still swollen.

110
00:03:40,825 --> 00:03:42,580
所以你才穿着运动裤
And that's why you're wearing sweat pants.

111
00:03:42,580 --> 00:03:43,600
好吧 我...
Okay, I was --

112
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,220
我还怕你就这样放弃
I was afraid you'd just given up.

113
00:03:45,220 --> 00:03:46,080
真是松了口气
So, whew!

114
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:46,820
它们会恢复的
They'll settle.

115
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:49,781
我打算随意地提到我的新健身计划
I'm gonna start casually referencing my new workout plan,

116
00:03:49,781 --> 00:03:51,340
然后在阵亡将士纪念日那天
and then I'm gonna debut them

117
00:03:51,340 --> 00:03:53,140
我会在拉古纳海滩展示出来
memorial day at Laguna beach.

118
00:03:53,260 --> 00:03:54,920
我个人认为你不需要这样
I personally don't think that you needed them,

119
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,280
但如果那能让你开心
but if they make you happy --

120
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,080
-会的 -那就好
- They do. - Good.

121
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:57,960
我总是想成为
I always wanted to be

122
00:03:57,960 --> 00:04:00,040
穿着紧身裤跑步的男人
one of those guys running in tights,

123
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,820
但我的小腿腿型还不够完美
but I was too embarrassed about my legs.

124
00:04:01,820 --> 00:04:02,980
如果你去跑步...
Well, if you'd just gone running --

125
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:04,020
你多虑了 米奇尔
Yep. You're overthinking this, Mitchell.

126
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,260
不开玩笑 你不能告诉小卡
No joke, you can't tell Cam.

127
00:04:06,260 --> 00:04:09,060
我爱他 但他是个超级大嘴巴
I love him, but he is a giant blabbermouth.

128
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:11,800
拜托 他没那么坏啦
Oh, come on. He's not that bad.

129
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:13,600
他只是 算了 我自己都不信
He just -- yeah, no, I can't even sell that.

130
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:20,560
杰 哪阵风把你吹来寒舍了
Jay, to what do I owe the pleasure?

131
00:04:20,571 --> 00:04:21,860
我只是来接曼尼的
I'm just here to pick up Manny.

132
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:23,020
没必要搞这么隆重
No need for a whole thing.

133
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,020
我不知道我为什么要那样对他
I don't know why I do that to him.

134
00:04:25,020 --> 00:04:27,320
他见到我总是很高兴
The guy's always so happy to see me.

135
00:04:28,123 --> 00:04:29,620
我懒得管了
I'm not gonna worry about it.

136
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:30,660
曼尼不在
Manny's not here.

137
00:04:30,685 --> 00:04:33,220
他和卢克去了赞德家
He actually went with Luke over to Xander's.

138
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:35,600
曼尼也没告诉你他要去那里吗
Whoa! Manny didn't tell you he was going either?

139
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,762
我告诉过你 那些男孩子在隐瞒什么
I told you, those boys are being cagey.

140
00:04:37,762 --> 00:04:38,600
有可能是
There is a chance

141
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:41,100
歌洛莉亚让我白跑一趟来惩罚我
Gloria let me drive over here for nothing as punishment.

142
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,340
我觉得她偷看了我的手机
I think she snooped on my phone,

143
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:44,570
读了几封邮件
read some of my e-mails.

144
00:04:44,570 --> 00:04:46,480
这样可不好 邮件是个人隐私
That's not cool. E-mails are private.

145
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,240
是找我借钱的朋友发来的
They were from a friend I loaned money to.

146
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:50,728
-绝对是你的特权 -一个女人
- 100% your prerogative. - A woman.

147
00:04:50,740 --> 00:04:51,560
不是吧
Oh, no.

148
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,820
我来告诉你我会怎么做
Well, I'll tell you what I'd do.

149
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,200
我会告诉我女人
I'd tell my lady,

150
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:57,160
你没权力干涉我的事
"You got no business being in my business."

151
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:58,720
尊重你男人的隐私
Respect your man's boundaries.

152
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:00,360
亲爱的 你答应过
Honey, you promised

153
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,920
做完布朗尼蛋糕后会洗盘子的
you'd clean the pan if you made brownies.

154
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,840
也许我忘了先喷点水
Well, maybe I forgot to spray it first

155
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:05,280
现在我让它泡着呢 女人
and I'm letting it soak, woman.

156
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,960
你来时他才这样说话
He only talks like this when you're around.

157
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,040
那他今天可以到此为止了
Well, then, he's done for the day.

158
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,460
好吧 很好
Oh, okay. Good.

159
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:11,129
-拜拜 爸 -回头见 伙计
- Bye, dad. - See ya...buddy.

160
00:05:12,623 --> 00:05:13,862
我追踪了卢克的手机
I have tracked Luke's cellphone,

161
00:05:13,862 --> 00:05:15,920
他可不在赞德家附近
and he is nowhere near his friend Xander's.

162
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:18,640
亲爱的 我像下一位沃兹尼克一样热爱科技
Honey, I love technology as much as the next Wozniak,

163
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,660
但我们真的要监视自家孩子吗
but are we sure we want to be spying on our kids?

164
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:23,320
不要 你也不该用伪造的身份
No, and you also shouldn't try to friend us

165
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:24,520
在Facebook上加我们好友
with fake Facebook profiles,

166
00:05:24,531 --> 00:05:25,680
玛戈特·拉克鲁瓦
Margot LaCroix.

167
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:26,500
我原本期望
I was really hoping some

168
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:27,920
你工作以后能不这么疯狂了呢
of this would go away when you got a job.

169
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,720
我直接问他怎么样
How about I just ask him?

170
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:30,480
天啊
Oh, man.

171
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,600
真希望你是我爸爸
I wish you were my dad.

172
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,860
能避免我犯多少我没犯过的错啊
The things I would have done.

173
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,480
-喂 -儿子
- Hello? - Hey, buddy.

174
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:36,689
只是想确定你平安到达了赞德家
Just making sure you got to Xander's okay.

175
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:37,720
是啊 平安无事
Yep. All good.

176
00:05:38,241 --> 00:05:39,534
真的吗 因为我听到汽车的声音
Really? 'cause I hear traffic...

177
00:05:39,534 --> 00:05:42,685
赞德住在一条很安静的街道上 对吧
...and Xander lives on a pretty quiet street, right?

178
00:05:42,685 --> 00:05:44,260
其实我们离开了赞德家
Actually, we left Xander's,

179
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:45,200
现在我们在萨米这里
and now we're at Sammy's.

180
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:47,120
这就讲得通了
Well, that makes perfect sense.

181
00:05:47,340 --> 00:05:48,700
你好好玩 注意安全
You have fun. Be safe.

182
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,500
他在撒谎
He's lying.

183
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,460
瞧 他朋友萨米住在这里
Look. His friend Sammy lives here.

184
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,220
而他在奥林匹克街和20号大街的路口
He's all the way over on Olympic and 20th.

185
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,580
奥林匹克街和20号大街吗
Olympic and 20th?

186
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:57,600
那是一家废品回收站
That's the old salvage yard

187
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,640
孩子们会去那里嗑药
where kids go to get high.

188
00:05:58,640 --> 00:05:59,480
-什么 -不
- What?! - No.

189
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:01,440
我们现在就要赶过去
Oh, we are going there right now.

190
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:03,000
等等 你确定吗
Wait, wait, wait. Are you sure?

191
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:07,000
我回答完这个问题后就出门
I'm gonna answer, and then I'm gonna walk away.

192
00:06:07,060 --> 00:06:07,280
好吗
Deal?

193
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:08,220
好
Okay.

194
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:10,160
我百分之420肯定
I'm 420% sure.

195
00:06:13,980 --> 00:06:16,840
她数学真差
Wow, she's bad at math.

196
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,640
爱人们
Hey, guys.

197
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:23,480
二爸
Hi, daddy.

198
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,680
午饭怎么样
How was lunch?

199
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,920
还不错
Oh, it was fine.

200
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:29,720
人们什么时候开始往沙拉里加三文鱼了
Hey, when did salmon become a thing that we put on salad?

201
00:06:29,860 --> 00:06:32,000
市里是2008年 郊区是2011年
2008 in the city, 2011 in the suburbs.

202
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,260
布雷特怎么样 今天又有什么好戏
How was Brett? What's the drama du jour?

203
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:34,720
没什么
Nothing.

204
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,960
拜托 他就不是个安分的角色
Oh, please. It's never nothing with that one.

205
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,780
他的烫发 假装自己有跟踪者
His perm, the stalker he pretends to have,

206
00:06:39,780 --> 00:06:42,420
在国税局工作就没人愿意和你约会了
nobody will date you when you work at the I.R.S.

207
00:06:42,420 --> 00:06:44,160
我烦死了 这次又是什么事
I hate it. What was it this time?

208
00:06:44,300 --> 00:06:45,560
说真的 没事
No, seriously, nothing.

209
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,860
也许在沙拉里加点鸡肉以外的东西
I guess it is nice to have something other than chicken

210
00:06:47,860 --> 00:06:48,580
也挺好的
to throw on there.

211
00:06:48,740 --> 00:06:49,920
你为什么逃避话题
Okay, why are you being so evasive?

212
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:52,140
我没有逃避啊 我...
I'm not being evasive. I--

213
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:53,220
瞧瞧这条新领带
Check out this new tie.

214
00:06:53,900 --> 00:06:55,020
我的天
Oh, my gosh.

215
00:06:55,020 --> 00:06:56,600
你在转移话题
You are redirecting me,

216
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,740
就像我们不想回答
like we do when Lily asks us a question

217
00:06:58,740 --> 00:06:59,360
莉莉的问题时
we don't want to answer

218
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,500
就把娃娃塞到她面前
and just throw a doll in her face.

219
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,720
等等
Wait a minute.

220
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,040
别胡思乱想了
Don't be ridiculous.

221
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,480
我怎么会这么糊弄一个成年人
Like I could do that with an adult.

222
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:06,740
看看我给你买了什么
Check out what I got for you.

223
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:08,360
太好了 压蒜器
Oh, good, yes. A garlic press.

224
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,540
我还真受不了我的手指闻起来
I am so tired of my fingers smell--

225
00:07:10,540 --> 00:07:11,380
我的天 你又在转移话题了
Oh, my gosh. You did it again.

226
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:13,500
-什么 -肯定很劲爆
- What's that? - Oh, it's got to be good.

227
00:07:13,540 --> 00:07:14,260
-什么 -告诉我
- What?! - Tell me.

228
00:07:14,420 --> 00:07:15,180
-不 没什么 -告诉我
- No, nothing. - Tell me.

229
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,280
-没什么好说的 -告诉我
- There's nothing to tell! - Tell me.

230
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,760
-没什么可说的 -告诉我 告诉我
- There's nothing to tell! - Tell me, tell me,

231
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,060
告诉我 告诉我
tell me, tell me.

232
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,400
来 回答我
Here. Answer me.

233
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:21,700
圣诞老人怎么去得了那么多房子
How does santa claus get to all of those houses?

234
00:07:21,860 --> 00:07:23,620
好了亲爱的 大人在说话呢
Okay, sweetie, the adults are talking right now,

235
00:07:23,620 --> 00:07:24,940
看爸爸给你买了什么
And look what daddy brought you.

236
00:07:26,780 --> 00:07:28,600
米奇尔 要是有人跟我说了什么
Mitchell, when somebody tells me something,

237
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,600
我都等不及回家告诉你
I can't wait to get home and tell you.

238
00:07:30,940 --> 00:07:31,940
你难道没有同感吗
Don't you feel the same?

239
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:32,960
我当然有了
Of course I do.

240
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:36,060
但是他 他让我保证不说的
But he -- he made me promise.

241
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:38,000
你知道吗 我们不需要分享秘密
Well, you know what? We don't have to share secrets.

242
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:38,820
不需要
We don't.

243
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,720
我们都已经分享了房子 生活
We already share a house, a life,

244
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:41,320
还有个女儿
a daughter.

245
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:42,680
你知道吗 我不
You know what?I don't --

246
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,800
我不知道我为什么这么在意
I don't know why I care so much.

247
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,740
好吧 好吧
Okay, all right, okay.

248
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:48,260
他做了小腿肌肉植入
He got calf implants.

249
00:07:48,272 --> 00:07:51,180
我的上帝 什么效果啊
Oh, my god! Oh, what do they look like?

250
00:07:51,180 --> 00:07:53,240
就像他偷运了两个葡萄柚一样
Like he's smuggling two grapefruits.

251
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:55,160
而且我的沙拉里也有葡萄柚
Which, by the way, were also on my salad.

252
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:56,420
这可是大新闻啊 太大了
Okay, this is huge. This is huge.

253
00:07:56,420 --> 00:07:57,700
都谁知道 我们得请他们来吃早午餐
Who all knows? We have to host a brunch.

254
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:59,400
不许跟任何人说 知道吗
Don't you dare tell a single person, okay?

255
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,540
他让我保证不告诉别人 特别是你
He made me promise not to tell anyone, especially you.

256
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:02,780
-特别是我 -拜托
- Especially me? - Oh, please.

257
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:04,460
谁都知道你守不住秘密
Everybody knows you're terrible at keeping secrets.

258
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:06,540
好吧 我还不知道我有这样的名声
Okay, well, I didn't know that was my reputation.

259
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,480
也许这是个大家都在瞒着我的秘密
Maybe that's a secret people have been keeping from me.

260
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,840
我不想伤害你的感情
I didn't mean to hurt your feelings.

261
00:08:09,860 --> 00:08:10,420
你已经伤了
Well, you did.

262
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,740
你知道让人难过的是什么吗
And you know what the sad thing is?

263
00:08:11,860 --> 00:08:14,320
我们本来可以一起嘲笑某人的小腿植入的
We could be laughing at someone's calf implants right now.

264
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,700
你在干什么
Hey, what are you doing?

265
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,780
我只是在欣赏你的睡姿
I'm just watching you sleep.

266
00:08:46,060 --> 00:08:47,320
你看上去真漂亮
You look so pretty.

267
00:08:48,260 --> 00:08:50,800
好吧 但别太大声喘气
Okay, but don't breathe so loud.

268
00:08:53,740 --> 00:08:55,440
你去哪儿啊
Hey, where are you going?!

269
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:08,060
我找不到可以进去的地方
I can't find a way in.

270
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:09,420
我什么都看不见
I can't see anything,

271
00:09:09,540 --> 00:09:10,620
但我听见他们的笑声了
but I hear them laughing.

272
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,020
你知道小孩子为什么会笑
And you know why kids laugh.

273
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:14,020
因为他们心中充满喜悦 而不是怀疑吗
Because their hearts are filled with joy, not suspicion?

274
00:09:14,020 --> 00:09:15,750
我们一定要搞清楚他们在干什么
We have got to see what is going on in there.

275
00:09:15,750 --> 00:09:17,286
把那个嗡嗡响的东西从车里拿出来
Get the drone thing out of the car.

276
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:19,800
那个'东西'可是专业航空摄影器材
That "Thing" is a professional aerial-photography tool

277
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,200
只为房地产事业服务
for real-estate use only!

278
00:09:21,340 --> 00:09:24,340
你用它拍你自己在沙滩堆小天使
You used it at the beach to film yourself doing sand angels.

279
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:25,800
那是我在拍宣传片
For my "Phil Dunphy Will Get You

280
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:27,460
《菲尔为您的海滨别墅提供天堂般好价格》
a Heavenly Deal On a Beach House" video.

281
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:30,040
专业房地产用具
A professional real-estate tool!

282
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,700
你答应过了的
That was the consensus.

283
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,020
喂 艾利克斯 你找到什么了
Hey, Alex. What did you find out?

284
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:40,320
好吧 这件事确实比海莉说的更重大
Okay, this is a bigger deal than Haley let on.

285
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:41,920
她班上只有5个人
Only five people in her class

286
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:42,980
被选上参加摄影展
were picked to show their photographs,

287
00:09:43,020 --> 00:09:44,060
海莉是其中之一
And haley was one of them.

288
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:45,060
太棒了
Amazing!

289
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,200
她班上一共不止5个人吧
Are there more than five people in the class?

290
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,540
是的 那是我最先核查的
Yes. That's the first thing I checked.

291
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,640
那我们确实一定要去看看了
Then we really do have to be there.

292
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:53,740
打电话邀请米奇尔舅舅和外公一起来
Call uncle Mitchell and grandpa and see if they can join us.

293
00:09:53,740 --> 00:09:55,280
她没发现你打探她的隐私吧
She didn't catch you snooping, did she?

294
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,380
没有 她在睡午觉
No. She's taking a nap.

295
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:58,480
她最近睡午觉比以前多多了
She's been taking a lot more naps lately.

296
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,820
去看看能不能查出是怎么回事
See what you can find out about that.

297
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,360
这样做太不对了
This is so wrong.

298
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:03,680
特殊时期特殊...
Eh, well, desperate times call for desperate --

299
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:04,800
你脑袋上是什么东西
What is on your head?

300
00:10:05,380 --> 00:10:08,340
用来防眩光的 但显然挡不住你的怒视
It provides glare protection, but apparently not from you.

301
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,740
赶紧开始吧
Let's just do this.

302
00:10:12,820 --> 00:10:14,540
我们是空军
We are airborne.

303
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:22,140
熟练地越过电线
Expertly navigating the wires.

304
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:22,860
你说得对
You're right.

305
00:10:22,860 --> 00:10:26,020
我们已经通过围墙 接近目标
We have cleared the wall. Approaching target.

306
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:27,720
他们在那里
There they are.

307
00:10:27,940 --> 00:10:28,680
他们在干什么
What are they doing?

308
00:10:29,020 --> 00:10:30,560
他们在什么东西上跳来跳去
They're jumping around on stuff.

309
00:10:30,571 --> 00:10:32,753
你看到什么可疑的东西了吗 比如
Do you see anything suspicious, like, um --

310
00:10:32,753 --> 00:10:35,489
比如烟或者什么相关设备 干酪玉米片
like smoke or paraphernalia, nachos?

311
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:36,780
不 他们在互相拍摄
No, they're filming each other

312
00:10:36,780 --> 00:10:38,640
还像僵尸那样跳来跳去
and moving around like zombies.

313
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:40,240
亲爱的 他们没在吸毒
Honey, they're not getting high.

314
00:10:40,260 --> 00:10:42,940
他们在拍电影 居然没带我
They're making a movie... without me!

315
00:10:42,940 --> 00:10:43,600
等等 等等 等等
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

316
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,120
那为什么卢克要撒谎说
Then why would luke have lied

317
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,780
去萨米家呢
about going to Sammy's, huh?

318
00:10:47,140 --> 00:10:48,180
亲爱的 你看
Honey, look.

319
00:10:48,760 --> 00:10:49,600
天啊
Oh, god.

320
00:10:51,340 --> 00:10:53,780
他还是我们的小乖乖
Well, he's still our little boy.

321
00:10:54,608 --> 00:10:55,780
我们得走了
Oh, we got to get out of here.

322
00:10:55,780 --> 00:10:56,860
可不能让他知道我们监视他
He cannot know we were spying on him.

323
00:10:56,900 --> 00:10:57,500
-快点 -已经晚了
- Come on. - Too late.

324
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,900
太晚了 他们发现了我的遥控飞机
It's too late. They're pointing at the drone.

325
00:10:59,020 --> 00:11:00,080
-什么 -我们被发现了
- What? - We're compromised!

326
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:00,900
快走 快走
Get out, get out!

327
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:01,660
我不能丢下遥控飞机
I can't leave the drone!

328
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:02,660
那是公司财产
It belongs to the office!

329
00:11:02,660 --> 00:11:03,783
他们还在因为我在白板上
They're still mad at me for writing

330
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:05,960
用永久性记号笔而生我的气呢
on the dry-erase board with a permanent marker!

331
00:11:06,380 --> 00:11:07,060
快上车
Get in the car.

332
00:11:08,460 --> 00:11:09,100
快走 快走
Go, go, go!

333
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,020
那是什么东西
What was that thing?

334
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:16,340
有人在偷拍我们
Somebody was filming us.

335
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:18,900
我爸有个那种玩意儿
Hey, my dad has one of those.

336
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,320
我知道怎么回事了
I know what's going on here.

337
00:11:21,340 --> 00:11:23,440
有个电影公司想偷我们的点子
A movie studio is trying to steal our idea!

338
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:25,000
斯皮尔伯格
Spielberg.

339
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:28,700
我就说过 僵尸跑酷是个超棒的点子
I told you guys, zombie parkour is a million-dollar idea.

340
00:11:28,860 --> 00:11:30,860
我还是没懂 僵尸移动速度不够快
I still don't get it. Zombies don't move well.

341
00:11:31,300 --> 00:11:32,060
吸血鬼估计会好一点
Vampires, maybe.

342
00:11:32,060 --> 00:11:34,380
标题我都想好了 "吸血鬼跑酷"
Plus, there's your title -- "Vam-par-kour."

343
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:36,400
我听不出有什么特别的
I don't hear it.

344
00:11:40,140 --> 00:11:40,960
瞧瞧
Look at that.

345
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:43,340
我最喜欢回到家被这样迎接了
That's how I like to be greeted when I come home!

346
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:46,900
曼尼今天跟朋友出去玩了
It turns out Manny's hanging with his friends today,

347
00:11:46,900 --> 00:11:48,180
所以我不用接他
so I didn't need to go pick him up.

348
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:49,849
是哦 不好意思忘了告诉你
Oh, right. So sorry. I forgot to tell you.

349
00:11:49,858 --> 00:11:51,400
不过 反正你也不是什么都告诉我
But, then, you don't tell me everything,

350
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:52,340
所以没什么所谓
so I guess it's okay.

351
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:53,240
你说这话太过分了
You got a lot of nerve.

352
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:55,376
你都已经查过我手机上的邮件了
You are the one who went through my emails on my phone.

353
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:57,320
你在说什么 我才没有
What are you talking about? No, I didn't.

354
00:11:57,420 --> 00:11:59,440
所以你不是因为我手机里的东西生气
So you're not mad at me for something you found on my phone?

355
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:00,200
不是
No.

356
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:02,380
好吧 那很好
All right, then. Great.

357
00:12:03,100 --> 00:12:04,120
没有伤害就不算犯规
No harm, no foul.

358
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:05,880
晚餐见
I'll see you at dinner.

359
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,640
把手机给我
Give me that phone!

360
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:07,600
我要看看你在藏什么
I want to see what you're hiding!

361
00:12:07,660 --> 00:12:08,700
我什么都没有藏
I'm not hiding anything.

362
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,140
我都不知道怎么用这该死的玩意儿
I don't even know how to use the damn thing.

363
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,900
看吧 我不小心拨给了艾丽克斯
Oh, look. I accidentally dialed Alex.

364
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:14,040
我先跟她说两句 她可崇拜我了
Let me say hi to her. The kid idolizes me.

365
00:12:14,660 --> 00:12:15,540
你好 宝贝
Hi, hon.

366
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:16,709
外公好
Hi, Grandpa.

367
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:18,820
问个问题 我要怎么删除手机上的邮件
Real quick, how do I delete e-mails on my phone?

368
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,740
你得先查一下收件箱
Well, first, you have to check your inbox,

369
00:12:20,740 --> 00:12:22,452
垃圾箱还有已发送邮件
your trash folder, and your sent folder.

370
00:12:22,452 --> 00:12:24,560
很多人会忽略已发送邮件
People often forget about the sent folder.

371
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,980
相信我 你要是也得抢在一个
Trust me, you get pretty adept at this

372
00:12:25,980 --> 00:12:26,860
喜欢偷窥的老妈之前删掉邮件
when you have to stay one step

373
00:12:26,860 --> 00:12:28,700
你也会很擅长这个的
ahead of your snooping mother.

374
00:12:28,700 --> 00:12:29,480
把电话给我
Give me the phone.

375
00:12:30,700 --> 00:12:31,340
我得挂了
Got to go.

376
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:33,460
好的 我 我手机里没有秘密
Uh, yeah, sure. I-I-I have nothing on here.

377
00:12:33,460 --> 00:12:34,720
我先挂了外公的电话
Let me just disconnect from grandpa,

378
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,500
好像挂不掉
which is not happening right now.

379
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:37,740
我看到你在干什么了 艾丽克斯
I can see what you're doing, Alex.

380
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:39,520
你干嘛要删掉米奇尔舅舅的短信
Why did just delete a text from uncle Mitchell?

381
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:40,560
我没有
I didn't!

382
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:41,860
你不是应该更担心
Shouldn't you be more worried

383
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:43,620
海莉衣柜里的护士服吗
that Haley has a nurse's uniform in her closet?!

384
00:12:44,020 --> 00:12:46,920
我一次只能顾得上一件事
I can only handle one thing at a time.

385
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,920
-你好 克莱尔 -你好 米奇尔
- Hey, Claire. - Hey, Mitchell.

386
00:12:50,180 --> 00:12:52,160
为什么艾丽克斯要删掉你给她的短信
Why would Alex delete a text from you off her phone?

387
00:12:52,340 --> 00:12:53,580
这个问题我不回答
I'm not answering that question.

388
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:55,160
手机是人家的私事
People's phones are their own business.

389
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:58,120
怎么了
What?

390
00:12:58,580 --> 00:13:00,580
我得挂了 把手机给我
I got to go. Give me your phone.

391
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:01,600
不行 凭什么
No. Why?

392
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:02,840
因为你在跟人发短信
Because you're texting someone

393
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:04,280
而且看起来很内疚
and you look very guilty right now.

394
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:06,160
我在玩"一起来填词"
Or I'm playing "Words with friends"

395
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,420
跟朗吉尼斯一起
with Longines.

396
00:13:07,420 --> 00:13:10,360
猜的词包括"小腿肌肉"和"植入"吧
None of those words better be "Calf" or "Implants."

397
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:11,940
天啊 给你 你知道吗
Oh, my gosh. Here. You know what?

398
00:13:11,940 --> 00:13:12,700
拿走我的手机
Take my phone...

399
00:13:12,700 --> 00:13:14,840
然后承认你一点都不信任我吧
and admit that you don't trust me,

400
00:13:14,851 --> 00:13:17,320
你的未婚夫 和你女儿的另一个爹
Your fiance, and co-father of your daughter.

401
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,280
查吧
Go ahead.

402
00:13:19,301 --> 00:13:20,020
按键啊
Push the button.

403
00:13:20,020 --> 00:13:22,920
没什么 我很好 我信任你
I'm good. No, I'm fine. I trust you.

404
00:13:34,511 --> 00:13:35,824
我的天啊
Oh, my gosh!

405
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:41,680
伙计们
Hey, guys.

406
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:44,040
想喝点红色的像酒的东西吗
You want some red stuff that reminds you of wine?

407
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:46,020
-当然 -我也是
- Sure. - Yep, I do.

408
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:48,000
展会什么时候开
So, when's this exhibit open?

409
00:13:48,300 --> 00:13:50,580
我不知道 细节大概还在杰的手机里
I don't know. Maybe the details are in Jay's phone.

410
00:13:50,580 --> 00:13:51,480
不过我希望不是
But I hope not,

411
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:53,800
毕竟那里面装的都是秘密
because everything is very secret on there.

412
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:55,540
你们大概也看出来了
Don't know if you caught that subtle cue.

413
00:13:55,580 --> 00:13:56,400
她在生我的气
She's mad at me.

414
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:57,860
他做了很可怕的事
He did something very terrible

415
00:13:57,860 --> 00:13:59,040
又不愿意让我知道
that he doesn't want me to know about.

416
00:13:59,040 --> 00:13:59,840
很可怕
"Very terrible"?

417
00:13:59,940 --> 00:14:01,040
除非你告诉我
Until you tell me what it is,

418
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:03,422
不然我会联想到最坏的可能
I'm gonna think the worst possible thing,

419
00:14:03,422 --> 00:14:05,540
比如你杀了个人
like maybe you killed somebody.

420
00:14:05,540 --> 00:14:07,960
不过你估计没那个能耐 是吧
But you don't have the stomach for that, do you?

421
00:14:08,940 --> 00:14:10,980
真高兴你们能来
Thank you so much for coming.

422
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:14,620
我知道你们都忙着工作和杂事
I know how busy you all are with work and errands

423
00:14:14,629 --> 00:14:17,260
还有卑鄙地在短信里说我闲话
and snarking about me on your cellphone.

424
00:14:17,260 --> 00:14:18,200
别纠结这事了 克莱尔
Let it go, Claire.

425
00:14:18,300 --> 00:14:19,660
说实话 菲尔 我不知道你是怎么忍受的
Honestly, Phil, i don't know how you do it.

426
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,600
我不知道你是怎么忍受的
I don't know how you do it.

427
00:14:21,060 --> 00:14:22,100
退一步海阔天空
Compromise and compassion.

428
00:14:22,100 --> 00:14:23,760
她不是真的在问你
She wasn't really asking you.

429
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,480
卢克来了
Hey, hey! Here comes Luke.

430
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,600
我们该说我们今天干了什么
What do we say we were doing today?

431
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:27,900
什么时候卢克关心过我们干了什么
When has Luke ever showed any interest in what we do?

432
00:14:28,100 --> 00:14:28,880
好吧 放轻松
Okay, but be cool.

433
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:30,160
如果他发现你追踪了他的手机
If he finds out you were tracking his phone,

434
00:14:30,171 --> 00:14:31,340
他会认为我们不信任他
he'll think we don't trust him.

435
00:14:31,340 --> 00:14:32,900
可不是 而且我也就不能继续追踪了
Ooh. Plus, then I could never do it again.

436
00:14:34,420 --> 00:14:35,060
你们好啊
Hey, guys!

437
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:35,840
你好
What's up?

438
00:14:35,980 --> 00:14:37,020
你今天过得怎么样
How was your day?

439
00:14:37,180 --> 00:14:38,520
还不错 你们知道的
It was fine, you know.

440
00:14:38,620 --> 00:14:39,660
我们不知道 我们怎么会知道
We don't know. How would we know?

441
00:14:39,660 --> 00:14:41,380
我们只是问问而已
Oh, we just mean what did you do?

442
00:14:41,380 --> 00:14:42,300
不是在问你都做了些什么
Not like, what did you do?

443
00:14:42,309 --> 00:14:44,170
只是顺口一问"嗨 你都做了些什么"
And we're just like, "Hey, what -- what'd you do?"

444
00:14:44,300 --> 00:14:45,600
你们表现得好奇怪
You guys are acting weird.

445
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:46,460
我们没有 你才奇怪
No, we're not. You are.

446
00:14:46,580 --> 00:14:47,540
你们今天都做了些什么
What did you do today?

447
00:14:47,540 --> 00:14:48,860
-我们只是待在家里 -我们去购物了
- We just stayed home - We went shopping.

448
00:14:48,860 --> 00:14:50,680
在家里网购裤子
Online shopping at home for pants.

449
00:14:50,740 --> 00:14:51,420
我们俩都需要裤子
We both needed pants.

450
00:14:51,420 --> 00:14:52,901
我跟你说过了他会问起的
I told you he was gonna ask.

451
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:53,640
等一下
Wait a minute.

452
00:14:53,940 --> 00:14:55,160
今天那是你的遥控飞机吗
Was that your drone today?

453
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:56,600
你们在暗中监视我们吗
Were you spying on us?

454
00:14:56,660 --> 00:14:58,320
对不起 是你妈妈逼我做的
I'm sorry. Your mom made me do it.

455
00:14:58,340 --> 00:14:59,680
她以为你在吸大麻
She thought you were smoking grass.

456
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:00,265
大麻 克莱尔
Grass? Claire.

457
00:15:00,265 --> 00:15:01,303
现在没人用大麻这个词了
No one says grass.

458
00:15:01,303 --> 00:15:03,080
我没说过是大麻
I never said grass.

459
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,460
这种想法也不是那么疯狂
It's not that crazy an idea.

460
00:15:04,660 --> 00:15:06,040
我们什么都没有吸
We weren't smoking anything.

461
00:15:06,040 --> 00:15:07,460
曼尼永远不会做那种事
Manny would never.

462
00:15:07,460 --> 00:15:08,120
谢谢 妈妈
Thank you, mom.

463
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:10,189
他总是很嫌弃那种事情
He's so judgy about those things.

464
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,160
我遛那条蠢狗的唯一原因
The only reason why I walk that stupid dog

465
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:14,360
就是我可以安静的抽会儿烟
is so that I can smoke my cigars in peace.

466
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:16,327
我简直不敢相信你监视我们
I can't believe you were spying on us.

467
00:15:16,340 --> 00:15:18,320
你不能再这么疑神疑鬼的了 克莱尔
You have to stop being so suspicious, Claire.

468
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:20,160
你要学会相信别人
It's okay to trust people.

469
00:15:20,540 --> 00:15:22,620
某些人可以 其他人 鬼知道
Some people. Other people, who knows?

470
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:24,620
你就疏忽了一秒钟
You turn your back for one second,

471
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:26,380
他们就不知在什么鬼地方
and they have a whole other family

472
00:15:26,380 --> 00:15:27,420
组建了一个新家庭
on the bad side of town.

473
00:15:27,460 --> 00:15:30,260
你就是我组建的新家庭
You are my other family from the bad side of town.

474
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:31,800
我不能一晚上都得忍受这些指责
Look, I can't stand this all night.

475
00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:33,840
我借钱给别人了 歌洛莉亚
I loaned someone money, Gloria.

476
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:36,280
我没有征求你的意见因为我知道你会生气
I didn't consult you. I knew you'd be pissed.

477
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:37,520
她只是一个朋友
She's just a friend.

478
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:38,140
"她"
"She"?

479
00:15:38,460 --> 00:15:39,800
这就是那个
Is this the woman

480
00:15:39,800 --> 00:15:41,680
你夜里梦见的女人吗
that you've been dreaming about at night,

481
00:15:41,680 --> 00:15:44,320
你甚至用性感的嗓音叫她
that you've been making the sexy noises and saying,

482
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:45,480
"宝贝 宝贝"
"Baby, baby"?

483
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,420
你这是在说些什么 当然不是
What the hell are you talking about?! No?!

484
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:49,680
那就证明一下 给我你的手机
Then prove it! Give me the phone!

485
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:50,580
实话说 你们这群人
Honestly, you people --

486
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:53,660
我指的是你们这些直人 简直太可笑了
and by that, I mean straight people are ridiculous!

487
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:56,280
每个人都有权力拥有一些隐私
Everyone's entitled to a little bit of privacy.

488
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,920
逼我说出朋友的秘密的人
Says the guy who forced me to

489
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:58,920
还好意思说出这种话
tell him our friend's secret.

490
00:15:58,980 --> 00:15:59,900
好吧 那是不一样的
Okay, that's different.

491
00:16:00,100 --> 00:16:00,940
那是八卦
That was gossip,

492
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:03,110
-八卦是属于所有人的 -好吧
- and gossip belongs to everyone. - Okay.

493
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:05,500
别老惦记着别人的手机了
Just keep your nose out of other people's phones.

494
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:07,360
你要么就相信他们要么就不
You either trust them or you don't.

495
00:16:07,560 --> 00:16:08,060
把手机给我
Give me that.

496
00:16:08,060 --> 00:16:09,420
-终于拿到了 -还给我 还给
- Ha! Yes. - Give it back. Give it --

497
00:16:09,420 --> 00:16:10,460
不行 但你可以拿我的看
No, but you can have mine,

498
00:16:10,460 --> 00:16:11,380
因为我光明磊落
'cause I have nothing to hide.

499
00:16:11,380 --> 00:16:12,280
我要了
I'll take that.

500
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,820
天哪 妈妈 不要这样做
Oh, my god. Mom, no, please, stop.

501
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:17,260
在这 在这 等等 我帮你拿出来
Here, here. Wait. Let me help you.

502
00:16:20,860 --> 00:16:22,304
这太疯狂了 对吧
It's crazy, right?

503
00:16:26,221 --> 00:16:27,447
我就知道
Ha ha. No, I knew it.

504
00:16:27,447 --> 00:16:28,100
笑死了
"L.O.L.

505
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:29,740
你觉得布雷特喜欢喝黑咖啡
Do you think Brett likes his coffee black

506
00:16:29,740 --> 00:16:30,660
还是一半咖啡一半水
or with calf-and-calf?"

507
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:32,500
好吧 我承认 我是有问题
Okay, I admit it. I have a problem.

508
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:34,740
但我只告诉了一个人 这消息太劲爆了
But I only told one person. It was too juicy.

509
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,620
而且克里斯宾说了他会保守秘密
And Crispin said he wouldn't tell anyone.

510
00:16:36,620 --> 00:16:37,880
这条是朗吉尼斯发来的
This is from Longines.

511
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:40,560
那个骗子克里斯宾 把手机还给我
Oh, that lying Crispin. Give me that.

512
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:42,380
我不敢相信他背叛了我的信任
I cannot believe he betrayed my trust.

513
00:16:42,380 --> 00:16:43,640
现在胡娇也插进来了
Now Pepper's chiming in.

514
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:45,780
大骗子 所有人
Jackals, all of them.

515
00:16:47,380 --> 00:16:48,340
胡娇真会说笑
Oh, that Pepper.

516
00:16:48,642 --> 00:16:50,165
我的天
Oh, my g--

517
00:16:55,260 --> 00:16:58,200
你让米奇尔叔叔帮你给我买生日礼物吗
Uncle Mitchell was helping you get me a birthday present?

518
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,800
是的 我想给你做饭
Yeah, I wanted to make you dinner

519
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:01,080
然后送你一瓶上好的红酒
and get you a nice bottle of wine,

520
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,780
那瓶他在新年夜给我们喝的
The one he served at new year's

521
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:03,540
你说你很喜欢
you said you liked.

522
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:05,440
我确实喜欢那瓶红酒
Ooh, I did like that wine.

523
00:17:05,840 --> 00:17:07,340
我很抱歉我把惊喜给毁了
I'm sorry I ruined the surprise.

524
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:08,300
你应该觉得抱歉
You should be.

525
00:17:08,580 --> 00:17:10,080
要不然你以为我在干什么
What did you think I was doing, anyways?

526
00:17:10,120 --> 00:17:10,920
你应该信任我才对
Give me some credit.

527
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:13,760
或许我们可以算是扯平了
Oh, well, then, maybe we could just call it even,

528
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:15,900
因为他说 我只是很吃惊
since he typed, "I'm just surprised

529
00:17:15,900 --> 00:17:17,920
她还记得那天晚上来过我家
She remembered coming to my house that night."

530
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:20,940
你回复说 啊哈哈哈
To which you responded, "Bahahahahahaha"

531
00:17:20,940 --> 00:17:23,080
后面还有五个感叹号
with like five exclamation points.

532
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:25,680
很公平
Seems fair.

533
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:31,840
找到你要找的东西了吗
Did you find what you were looking for?

534
00:17:32,300 --> 00:17:32,660
没有
No.

535
00:17:33,600 --> 00:17:35,040
她是俱乐部的服务员
She's a waitress at the club.

536
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:38,060
她的车被男朋友砸了 所以我帮了她
Her boyfriend crashed her car, so I helped her,

537
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:40,280
因为我们之间有个有趣的游戏
because we have that fun game where I order salad

538
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:41,400
每次我点沙拉她都给我上薯条
and she brings me french fries.

539
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,820
但是我从来没梦见过她
But I never dreamt of her.

540
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,040
昨天晚上我做了个噩梦
Last night, I had a nightmare.

541
00:17:45,220 --> 00:17:46,920
乔爬到一栋高楼的天台上
Joe got out onto a ledge of a tall building.

542
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,080
我救不到他
I couldn't get to him.

543
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:48,980
我特别着急
I was very upset,

544
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:51,500
我可能在梦里还哭了
and I think I might have cried a little in my sleep,

545
00:17:52,280 --> 00:17:53,880
你可能觉得那听起来很色情
which might have sounded like sex to you,

546
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:54,660
这点我很不喜欢
which I don't love.

547
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,720
但乔才是我喊的那个"宝贝"
But that's the "Baby" I was talking about.

548
00:17:58,760 --> 00:17:59,160
真的吗
Really?

549
00:18:00,220 --> 00:18:01,020
很吓人
That's scary.

550
00:18:01,380 --> 00:18:01,780
是啊
Yes!

551
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:03,560
苍天在上
Why in god's name

552
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:05,320
我怎么会梦到别的女人
would I need to dream about another woman?

553
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:08,620
你这么一说
Now that you say it out loud,

554
00:18:08,620 --> 00:18:10,640
我也觉得的确很离谱
it does seem kind of crazy.

555
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:16,180
不骄傲地说 我并没有梦到乔
I'm not proud of this, but the dream wasn't about Joe.

556
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:19,460
而是这个小宝贝
It was about this little baby right here.

557
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:20,440
没错
That's right.

558
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:23,700
你差点从天台上掉下去 吓死爸爸了
You almost fell off a ledge, and daddy was so scared.

559
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:32,200
我的天 是我们
Oh, my gosh. It's us!

560
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:33,940
全都是
All over the place.

561
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:36,800
我不知道现在是什么感觉
I don't know how I feel about this.

562
00:18:37,340 --> 00:18:39,860
你看 你有多喜欢八卦
Okay, okay, now, see -- look how much you gossip.

563
00:18:40,060 --> 00:18:41,560
海莉都用胶片捕捉到了
Haley managed to capture it on film.

564
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:43,420
再看看你 笑得见牙不见眼
And look at you, smiling ear to ear.

565
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:45,640
你知道你最爱听我说八卦了
You know you love it when I give you the dirt.

566
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:46,820
这倒是提醒我了
Oh, which reminds me,

567
00:18:46,820 --> 00:18:49,593
猜猜谁刚因为向服务生乱献殷勤
guess who got kicked out of a hotel bar

568
00:18:49,593 --> 00:18:52,040
被赶出大堂酒吧了
for making unwanted advances at the waitstaff?

569
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:53,940
我不想知道 那不关我的事
I don't want to know. It's none of my business.

570
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:54,580
好吧
Okay.

571
00:18:56,020 --> 00:18:57,200
约坦 赞尼尔 还是萨尔
Jotham. Zaniel. Sal.

572
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:57,900
告诉我吧
Just tell me!

573
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:58,480
我不知道
I don't know.

574
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:01,180
老天 看看我脸上的皱纹
Good god, look at those lines on my face.

575
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:03,020
我什么时候变得这么老了
When did I get so old?

576
00:19:03,020 --> 00:19:06,000
那是笑纹 因为你正抱着你的儿子
Their smile lines because you're holding your son

577
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:09,240
你爱他 在睡梦中都要保护他
who you love, who you had to protect in your dream.

578
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:12,280
她是个很棒的摄影师
She is a great photographer,

579
00:19:12,740 --> 00:19:13,960
虽然每个人都盯着我的
even though it's embarrassing

580
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,640
六块腹肌 让我很不好意思
that everyone's staring at my six-pack.

581
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:17,000
她真的很棒
She is really good.

582
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:19,100
你看到我的照片了吗
Have you seen my photo?

583
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:20,920
歌洛莉亚看到了吗
Has Gloria seen this?

584
00:19:20,980 --> 00:19:21,820
歌洛莉亚看到什么
Gloria see what?

585
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:24,800
我觉得我看起来不错
I think I look good.

586
00:19:25,380 --> 00:19:27,440
她都没看到照片里也有我
Wow. She didn't even see me in there.

587
00:19:27,780 --> 00:19:30,460
天啊 你们来干什么
Oh, my god! What are you guys doing here?!

588
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:31,980
艾丽克斯邀请我们来的
Alex invited us.

589
00:19:32,180 --> 00:19:33,500
你 你怎么知道是在这里的
You? How did you know where this was?

590
00:19:33,500 --> 00:19:35,903
传单从你的背包里掉出来了
Uh, the flier fell out of your backpack.

591
00:19:35,903 --> 00:19:36,760
骗人
Liar.

592
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:37,400
妈妈逼我的
Mom made me.

593
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:38,800
我们是来支持你的
We came to be supportive.

594
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:41,500
我告诉你们不要来的 这太不尊重人了
I told you not to come here. This is such a violation!

595
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:42,657
她也对我这样
She just did it to me, too.

596
00:19:42,657 --> 00:19:43,740
她看了我的短信
She read my texts.

597
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:44,440
那没什么
That's nothing.

598
00:19:44,540 --> 00:19:46,380
她用了个遥控飞机监视我
She totally used a drone to spy on me.

599
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:48,640
我有正当理由使用遥控飞机
Use of the drone was completely justified.

600
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:50,460
-你有病吗 -你在说什么
- What is wrong with you?! - What are you talking about?

601
00:19:51,158 --> 00:19:52,160
行了 别吵了
All right, knock it off.

602
00:19:52,160 --> 00:19:55,460
你们根本不知道做家长有多难
You have no idea how hard it is to be a parent,

603
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:57,440
要费尽心思打探孩子们的状况
to figure out what's going on with your kid

604
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:59,420
你们只会咕哝或者说"还行"
when all you get is a grunt or a "Fine"

605
00:19:59,420 --> 00:20:00,520
或者甩甩头发
or a flick of the hair.

606
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,300
保护你们是我的责任
It's my job to protect you

607
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:04,380
要保证你们做的选择是对的
and make sure you're making good choices.

608
00:20:04,580 --> 00:20:06,440
如果我在这样做的时候
And if I step over the line every now and again

609
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,920
偶尔有点过分 难免
when I'm doing that, tough.

610
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:09,940
只有知道你们平安
Knowing you're safe is the only thing

611
00:20:09,940 --> 00:20:11,060
我晚上才能睡着
that lets me sleep at night.

612
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,700
我还以为是靠酒精
I thought it was the wine.

613
00:20:16,260 --> 00:20:17,020
恭喜你 海莉
Congratulations, Haley.

614
00:20:17,340 --> 00:20:17,880
恭喜什么
For what?

615
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:19,240
有人刚刚买下了你拍的那张
Someone just bought your photo

616
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:20,500
这位美女的照片
of this beautiful lady.

617
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:21,780
今天卖出的第一张
First one sold.

618
00:20:22,881 --> 00:20:25,220
天啊
Oh, my god!

619
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:28,120
有人花钱买了我的作品 我的
Someone paid for something that I made! Me!

620
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:30,040
我真高兴大家能在这里一起见证
I am so psyched we were here for this!

621
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:30,800
我也是
Me too!

622
00:20:31,416 --> 00:20:33,070
你现在高兴我们来了吗
Now you're glad we're here, huh?

623
00:20:33,070 --> 00:20:34,120
我必须承认
I got to admit,

624
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:35,820
你这张照片美极了
that's a gorgeous picture of you.

625
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:37,480
里面也有我 爸
I'm in it, too, dad.
